// Repro (2026-11-19): a pedal released at the end of a two-note tremolo. Kuecken Op.47-3 bar 66, left hand (6/8).
// '@!sustain' after the tremolo's block is an error; on the second note inside it, lysc's MIDI lifts the pedal one 64th
// into the tremolo (LilyPond: at the written second head, 3/16 in). Needs a lysc with the beat repeat (b3dce0d24).
octave absolute
time 6/8
key b major
part lh { clef bass }

section A {
  lh {
    <fis fis,>16@stemDown@sustain <fis b>64[ dis'64 <fis b>64 dis'64] { <fis b>64[ dis'64 <fis b>64 dis'64] } % % % repeat tremolo 12 { <fis b>64 dis'64@!sustain } |
  }
}

score { staff lh }